{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55301","headline":"日诗 · 赵匡胤","name":"日诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲出未出光辣达（一作「太阳初出光赫赫」），千山万山如火发，须臾走向天下来（一作「一轮顷刻上天衢」），逐却（一作「退」）残（一作「羣」）星赶却（一作「与残」）月。\n（见《说郛》卷五陈郁《藏一话腴》，校以陈岩肖《庚溪诗话》卷上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵匡胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}